<title>USA: Scios names Rosenkranz as president.</title>
<headline>Scios names Rosenkranz as president.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scios Inc said Tuesday it has promoted Roberto Rosenkranz to the position of president.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Dr. Rosenkranz, 47, will continue to hold the title of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Richard Casey has relinquished the role of president and will remain as chief executive officer and chairman.</p>
</text>
